  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Asish Jana vs Unknown on 6 July, 2022 Author: Debangsu Basak Bench: Debangsu Basak 06.07.2022 Serial no. 03 [Dd] (Anticipatory bail) (Rejected) Crm (A) 2349 of 2022 In re : An Application for Anticipatory Bail under Section 438 of the Code of Criminal Procedure in connection with Madhyamgram Police Station Case No. 208 of 2022 dated 28.04.2022 under Sections 272/273/420/120B of the Indian Penal Code and Sections 56/57/63 of Food Safety And Standards Act, 2006. -And- In the matter of : Asish Jana ... ...Petitioner Mr. Swapan Kr. Mallick, Mr. Tarun Kr. Ghosh, Ms. Suvasree Ghose, Ms. Sudeshna Das, Advocate ... ... For the Petitioner Mr. T. D. Nandy, Mr. Antrikhya Basu, Advocates ... ...",
    "facts": "The order dated June 7, 2022 required the petitioner to report to the Investigating Officer once in a week until further orders. The report of the Investigating Officer states that the petitioner did not comply with such order. The chemical examination report states that the Sample Pakage Drinking Water is substandard and unsafe food under the Food and Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
